# A span mark changes the span of the node the action builds: an
# alternative that builds none (here it passes an element through) has no
# span to change.
# error: span_mark_no_node.grammar:19:15:
# error: span marks need an action that builds a node, `(kind ...)`
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    semi
    comma
    eof
    err
';'                                         → semi
','                                         → comma
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
top! = IDENT -";"                           → 1
